          │  [           Shift timing -100 ms                        │
          │  ]           Shift timing +100 ms                        │
          │  \           Reset timing offset                         │
          │  -           Cylinder speed -10%                         │
          │  =, +        Cylinder speed +10%                         │
          │  0           Reset cylinder speed                        │
          │  Up          Scroll up (unsynced)                        │
          │  Down        Scroll down (unsynced)                      │
